{
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "builtIn": 1,
        "datasource": { "type": "grafana", "uid": "-- Grafana --" },
        "enable": true,
        "hide": true,
        "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
        "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
        "type": "dashboard"
      }
    ]
  },
  "description": "etcd WAL fsync on a spinning disk stalls the API server, then Patroni loses its Kubernetes leader lock and Postgres goes unreachable.",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "id": null,
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "Postmortem",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "https://dbslone.medium.com/my-kubernetes-cluster-died-because-etcd-was-on-a-spinning-disk-2c32feb730d9",
      "targetBlank": true
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "content": "Every Kubernetes API write goes through etcd, and etcd fsyncs its write-ahead log on every commit. When that fsync is slow, the API server is slow. When the API server is slow enough, anything that depends on it starts timing out.\n\nPatroni (the HA manager in the Zalando Postgres operator) uses Kubernetes as its consensus store. It has to renew its leader lock through the API. A spinning disk makes the fsync slow enough that the renewal fails, Postgres becomes unreachable, and the outage keeps compounding.\n\n**Yellow** is past this host's normal tail: WAL fsync p99 above **100ms**, backend commit p99 above **200ms**. **Red** is **500ms**, long enough that API writes start to stall. etcd's published server-SSD budgets are 10ms and 25ms. This M.2 is under that most of the time (p50 under 2ms); those lines would sit yellow on a consumer-drive flush tail.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "The chain",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            {
              "options": {
                "0": { "color": "red", "index": 1, "text": "DOWN" },
                "1": { "color": "green", "index": 0, "text": "UP" }
              },
              "type": "value"
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "red", "value": null }, { "color": "green", "value": 1 }] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 0, "y": 5 },
      "id": 2,
      "options": { "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none", "justifyMode": "auto", "orientation": "auto", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false }, "textMode": "auto" },
      "title": "etcd scrape",
      "type": "stat",
      "targets": [{ "expr": "max(up{job=\"etcd\"})", "legendFormat": "up", "refId": "A" }]
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            {
              "options": {
                "0": { "color": "red", "index": 1, "text": "NO LEADER" },
                "1": { "color": "green", "index": 0, "text": "HAS LEADER" }
              },
              "type": "value"
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "red", "value": null }, { "color": "green", "value": 1 }] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 4, "y": 5 },
      "id": 3,
      "options": { "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none", "justifyMode": "auto", "orientation": "auto", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false }, "textMode": "auto" },
      "title": "etcd leader",
      "type": "stat",
      "targets": [{ "expr": "min(etcd_server_has_leader{job=\"etcd\"})", "legendFormat": "leader", "refId": "A" }]
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "description": "Yellow at 100ms, red at 500ms. Usual p99 here is about 50ms. etcd's server-SSD budget is 10ms.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 1,
          "unit": "s",
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "yellow", "value": 0.1 }, { "color": "red", "value": 0.5 }] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 8, "y": 5 },
      "id": 4,
      "options": { "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "area", "justifyMode": "auto", "orientation": "auto", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false }, "textMode": "auto" },
      "title": "WAL fsync p99",
      "type": "stat",
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(etcd_disk_wal_fsync_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"etcd\"}[$rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p99",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "description": "Yellow at 200ms, red at 500ms. Usual p99 here is about 100ms, while p50 is about 2ms. etcd's server-SSD budget is 25ms.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 1,
          "unit": "s",
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "yellow", "value": 0.2 }, { "color": "red", "value": 0.5 }] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 12, "y": 5 },
      "id": 5,
      "options": { "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "area", "justifyMode": "auto", "orientation": "auto", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false }, "textMode": "auto" },
      "title": "Backend commit p99",
      "type": "stat",
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(etcd_disk_backend_commit_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"etcd\"}[$rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p99",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "description": "How long the API server waited on etcd for create, update, and delete. This is the latency Patroni sees when it renews its lock.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 1,
          "unit": "s",
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "yellow", "value": 0.1 }, { "color": "red", "value": 0.5 }] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 16, "y": 5 },
      "id": 6,
      "options": { "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "area", "justifyMode": "auto", "orientation": "auto", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false }, "textMode": "auto" },
      "title": "API etcd write p99",
      "type": "stat",
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(etcd_request_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"kubernetes-api-servers\", operation=~\"create|update|delete\"}[$rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p99",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "description": "Proposals waiting on the slow disk. A climb here means commits are backing up.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "yellow", "value": 5 }, { "color": "red", "value": 20 }] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 20, "y": 5 },
      "id": 7,
      "options": { "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "area", "justifyMode": "auto", "orientation": "auto", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false }, "textMode": "auto" },
      "title": "Proposals pending",
      "type": "stat",
      "targets": [{ "expr": "sum(etcd_server_proposals_pending{job=\"etcd\"})", "legendFormat": "pending", "refId": "A" }]
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "description": "Dashed lines are 100ms and 500ms for this M.2. etcd's server-SSD budget is 10ms.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10, "lineWidth": 2, "showPoints": "never", "spanNulls": true, "thresholdsStyle": { "mode": "dashed" } },
          "unit": "s",
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "yellow", "value": 0.1 }, { "color": "red", "value": 0.5 }] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 9 },
      "id": 8,
      "options": { "legend": { "calcs": ["mean", "max"], "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } },
      "title": "WAL fsync duration",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le) (rate(etcd_disk_wal_fsync_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"etcd\"}[$rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(etcd_disk_wal_fsync_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"etcd\"}[$rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p99",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "description": "Dashed lines are 200ms and 500ms for this M.2. etcd's server-SSD budget is 25ms.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10, "lineWidth": 2, "showPoints": "never", "spanNulls": true, "thresholdsStyle": { "mode": "dashed" } },
          "unit": "s",
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "yellow", "value": 0.2 }, { "color": "red", "value": 0.5 }] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 9 },
      "id": 9,
      "options": { "legend": { "calcs": ["mean", "max"], "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } },
      "title": "Backend commit duration",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le) (rate(etcd_disk_backend_commit_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"etcd\"}[$rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(etcd_disk_backend_commit_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"etcd\"}[$rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p99",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "description": "API server time spent in etcd. Patroni's lock renewal is one of these writes.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10, "lineWidth": 2, "showPoints": "never", "spanNulls": true }, "unit": "s" },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 17 },
      "id": 10,
      "options": { "legend": { "calcs": ["mean", "max"], "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } },
      "title": "API server etcd latency p99",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le, operation) (rate(etcd_request_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"kubernetes-api-servers\"}[$rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{operation}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "description": "Mutating API requests. These are the calls that time out once etcd fsync stalls.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10, "lineWidth": 2, "showPoints": "never", "spanNulls": true }, "unit": "s" },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 17 },
      "id": 11,
      "options": { "legend": { "calcs": ["mean", "max"], "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } },
      "title": "API server write latency p99",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le, verb) (rate(apiserver_request_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"kubernetes-api-servers\", verb=~\"POST|PUT|PATCH|DELETE\"}[$rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{verb}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10, "lineWidth": 2, "showPoints": "never", "spanNulls": true }, "unit": "ops" },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 25 },
      "id": 12,
      "options": { "legend": { "calcs": ["mean", "max"], "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } },
      "title": "Leader changes, failed proposals, slow apply",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(etcd_server_leader_changes_seen_total{job=\"etcd\"}[$rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "leader changes",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(etcd_server_proposals_failed_total{job=\"etcd\"}[$rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "failed proposals",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(etcd_server_slow_apply_total{job=\"etcd\"}[$rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "slow apply",
          "refId": "C"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(etcd_server_health_failures{job=\"etcd\"}[$rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "health failures",
          "refId": "D"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10, "lineWidth": 2, "showPoints": "never", "spanNulls": true }, "unit": "bytes" },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 25 },
      "id": 13,
      "options": { "legend": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } },
      "title": "etcd database size vs quota",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "etcd_mvcc_db_total_size_in_bytes{job=\"etcd\"}",
          "legendFormat": "db size {{instance}}",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "etcd_server_quota_backend_bytes{job=\"etcd\"}",
          "legendFormat": "quota {{instance}}",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "refresh": "30s",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "tags": ["etcd", "disk", "patroni"],
